---
---

<aside class="editorial-sidebar" aria-label="Quick directory links">
  <!-- Quick Tools Card -->
  <div class="sidebar-card">
    <div class="sidebar-header">
      <h3 class="header-title">Naming Tools</h3>
    </div>
    <div class="sidebar-body">
      <div class="tools-list">
        <a href="/name-generator" class="tool-link-item">
          <div class="tool-icon-circle">
            <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"></circle><path d="M19.4 15a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 .33 1.82l.06.06a2 2 0 0 1 0 2.83 2 2 0 0 1-2.83 0l-.06-.06a1.65 1.65 0 0 0-1.82-.33 1.65 1.65 0 0 0-1 1.51V21a2 2 0 0 1-2 2 2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-.09A1.65 1.65 0 0 0 9 19.4a1.65 1.65 0 0 0-1.82.33l-.06.06a2 2 0 0 1-2.83 0 2 2 0 0 1 0-2.83l.06-.06a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 .33-1.82 1.65 1.65 0 0 0-1.51-1H3a2 2 0 0 1-2-2 2 2 0 0 1 2-2h.09A1.65 1.65 0 0 0 4.6 9a1.65 1.65 0 0 0-.33-1.82l-.06-.06a2 2 0 0 1 0-2.83 2 2 0 0 1 2.83 0l.06.06a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 1.82.33H9a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 1-1.51V3a2 2 0 0 1 2-2 2 2 0 0 1 2 2v.09a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 1 1.51 1.65 1.65 0 0 0 1.82-.33l.06-.06a2 2 0 0 1 2.83 0 2 2 0 0 1 0 2.83l-.06.06a1.65 1.65 0 0 0-.33 1.82V9a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 1.51 1H21a2 2 0 0 1 2 2 2 2 0 0 1-2 2h-.09a1.65 1.65 0 0 0-1.51 1z"></path></svg>
          </div>
          <div class="tool-meta">
            <strong class="tool-name">Name Generator</strong>
            <span class="tool-desc">Find matching Korean first names</span>
          </div>
        </a>
        <a href="/favorites" class="tool-link-item">
          <div class="tool-icon-circle">
            <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M12 21.35l-1.45-1.32C5.4 15.36 2 12.28 2 8.5 2 5.42 4.42 3 7.5 3c1.74 0 3.41.81 4.5 2.09C13.09 3.81 14.76 3 16.5 3 19.58 3 22 5.42 22 8.5c0 3.78-3.4 6.86-8.55 11.54L12 21.35z"/></svg>
          </div>
          <div class="tool-meta">
            <strong class="tool-name">Saved Favorites</strong>
            <span class="tool-desc">Review your bookmarked list</span>
          </div>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Browse by Gender & Category -->
  <div class="sidebar-card">
    <div class="sidebar-header">
      <h3 class="header-title">Explore by Category</h3>
    </div>
    <div class="sidebar-body">
      <div class="category-chips-grid">
        <a href="/girl-names" class="cat-pill pill-girl">Girl Names</a>
        <a href="/boy-names" class="cat-pill pill-boy">Boy Names</a>
        <a href="/unisex-names" class="cat-pill pill-unisex">Unisex Names</a>
        <a href="/surnames" class="cat-pill pill-surname">Korean Surnames</a>
        <a href="/hanja" class="cat-pill pill-hanja">Hanja Dictionary</a>
        <a href="/names/meaning" class="cat-pill pill-theme">Names by Meaning</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Cultural Note Card -->
  <div class="sidebar-card cultural-card">
    <div class="cultural-badge">Korean Culture Note</div>
    <p class="cultural-text">
      In Korean naming tradition, given names usually feature two Sino-Korean syllables chosen to balance harmonious virtues and familial generation characters (Dollimja).
    </p>
    <a href="/guides/how-korean-names-work" class="cultural-link">Learn about naming rules &rarr;</a>
  </div>
</aside>

<style>
  .editorial-sidebar {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  .sidebar-card {
    background: var(--bg-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-xs);
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .sidebar-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
    background: var(--color-jade-surface);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-jade-border);
  }

  .header-icon {
    font-size: 1rem;
  }

  .header-title {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-jade);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.03em;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .sidebar-body {
    padding: 1rem;
  }

  .tools-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.65rem;
  }

  .tool-link-item {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    padding: 0.5rem 0.6rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    transition: background-color 0.15s ease;
  }

  .tool-link-item:hover {
    background-color: var(--color-jade-surface);
  }

  .tool-icon-circle {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 34px;
    height: 34px;
    background: var(--bg-surface-warm);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
    border-radius: var(--radius-full);
    font-size: 1rem;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .tool-meta {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .tool-name {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-jade);
  }

  .tool-desc {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  .category-chips-grid {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.45rem;
  }

  .cat-pill {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 0.35rem 0.65rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-full);
    font-size: 0.775rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
    background: var(--bg-surface);
    color: var(--text-body);
    transition: all 0.15s ease;
  }

  .cat-pill:hover {
    border-color: var(--color-jade);
    background: var(--color-jade-surface);
    color: var(--color-jade);
  }

  .pill-girl:hover { border-color: var(--gender-girl); color: var(--gender-girl); }
  .pill-boy:hover { border-color: var(--gender-boy); color: var(--gender-boy); }
  .pill-unisex:hover { border-color: var(--gender-unisex); color: var(--gender-unisex); }

  .cultural-card {
    padding: 1.25rem;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--bg-surface) 0%, var(--color-jade-surface) 100%);
  }

  .cultural-badge {
    display: inline-block;
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-jade);
    background: var(--color-jade-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-jade-border);
    padding: 0.15rem 0.5rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-full);
    margin-bottom: 0.65rem;
  }

  .cultural-text {
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    color: var(--text-body);
    line-height: 1.5;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .cultural-link {
    font-size: 0.775rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-jade);
  }

  .cultural-link:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }
</style>
